                <p>The documentation that follows comprises the major Conference agreements and
                    decisions, selections from Ambassador Douglas’ telegraphic reports on the proceedings of the
                    Conference, various Department instructions and observations, and certain other
                    related, supplementary papers. There appears to be no complete collection of
                    United States Delegation minutes of the various meetings constituting this
                    portion of the London Conference on Germany. Such Delegation <pb facs="0228"
                        n="194" xml:id="pg194"/> minutes as are available, the texts of the formal
                    Conference documents, and a variety of Delegation position papers, drafts, and
                    correspondence are included in CFM Files, Lot
                    M–88, Box 118.</p>
